From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: babarot <b4b4r07@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 17:25:18 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Add a worktree space token

The token is the checkout's directory name, which other sessions go by.
It is left out when the checkout is named after the space's branch,
where it would only repeat the branch.
